{"id":"38f802289559e5da","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-consistent-set.md","title":"Local Modal Consistency","display":"df-modal-consistent-set — Local Modal Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-consistent-set","aliases":["89-df-modal-consistent-set"],"display":"df-modal-consistent-set — Local Modal Consistency","depends_on":["[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-consistent-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-consistent-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-consistent-set — Local Modal Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 表示成员来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的有限序列，包含空序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\">\\(\\bigwedge\\)</span> 取已有有序折叠。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCS}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{MCS}_L\\)</span> 是下述定义的局部一致性与极大一致性谓词，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box})\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Delta\\in\\Gamma^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \n(\\neg\\bigwedge\\Delta\\notin L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{MCS}_L(\\Gamma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ (A\\in\\Gamma\\lor\\neg A\\in\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Delta\\in\\Gamma^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \n(\\neg\\bigwedge\\Delta\\notin L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{MCS}_L(\\Gamma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ (A\\in\\Gamma\\lor\\neg A\\in\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 6 章，印刷页 85–87；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n局部一致性允许必然化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的定理，但不允许把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 中的世界假设任意必然化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\varnothing)\\)</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin L\">\\(\\bot\\notin L\\)</span>。MCS 对 MP 闭合、包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 且不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 恰含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\neg A\">\\(A,\\neg A\\)</span> 之一。此接口不同于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3987a9cfc50008a9\" href=\"?note=3987a9cfc50008a9\" title=\"89-df-gl-consistent-extension\">89-df-gl-consistent-extension</a> 的公理扩张一致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-consistent-extension","status":"resolved","id":"3987a9cfc50008a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 6 章，印刷页 85–87；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n局部一致性允许必然化 $L$ 的定理，但不允许把 $\\Gamma$ 中的世界假设任意必然化。$\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\varnothing)$ 等价于 $\\bot\\notin L$。MCS 对 MP 闭合、包含 $L$ 且不含 $\\bot$；每个 $A$ 恰含 $A,\\neg A$ 之一。此接口不同于 [[89-df-gl-consistent-extension]] 的公理扩张一致性。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MCS}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Delta\\in\\Gamma^{<\\omega}\\ \n(\\neg\\bigwedge\\Delta\\notin L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{MCS}_L(\\Gamma)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ (A\\in\\Gamma\\lor\\neg A\\in\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A,\\neg A","display":false}],"bytes":1596,"backlinks":[{"id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a1ee52f416d487e3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8b4548588dec7bd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"646a96fe655f6d74","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0455ac768bd466bb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"92c4449a6fa3b997","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]] → [[89-df-local-modal-consequence]] → [[89-lem-local-modal-deduction]] → [[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]] → [[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]] → [[89-df-canonical-model]] → [[89-lem-canonical-successor]] → [[89-lem-canonical-truth]] → [[89-thm-canonical-model]]"}],"outgoing":["bdef52f3ff411531","ca21b68a25f1afc2","3987a9cfc50008a9"]}